  {
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "\n> If this dtype is not natively supported in your hardware, try `uint8` instead ?\n\nif your model is in fp8 from the start (loaded from disk in fp8), re-quantizing it to an integer datatype introduces further error. 3090s *are* able to convert fp8 to other dtypes, without torch.compile the sample code works on GPU.",
